<import src="../../components/states.wxml"/><view class="page"><template is="feedback" data="{{loading,error}}"/><view class="heading">支付模拟配置</view><view class="notice warn section">仅本地模拟，配置立即影响消费者入口。禁止输入真实支付凭据或AI密钥。管理员权限由服务层校验。</view><view class="card section"><view class="row config-row"><text>开启模拟入口</text><switch checked="{{config.enabled}}" data-key="enabled" bindchange="toggle"/></view><view class="row config-row"><text>允许iOS模拟购买</text><switch checked="{{config.iosAllowed}}" data-key="iosAllowed" bindchange="toggle"/></view><view class="row config-row"><text>使用内置DEMO演示凭据</text><switch checked="{{config.demoCredentials}}" data-key="demoCredentials" bindchange="toggle"/></view><view class="caption mt">演示商户号 {{config.merchantId || "尚未填入"}}</view><view class="caption mt">配置版本 {{config.revision}} · 无真实密钥保存与调用</view><button class="btn mt" bindtap="save" disabled="{{busy}}" loading="{{busy}}">保存生效</button></view></view>